      "content": "those are a good start. for the Oak Ridge one, could you expand a bit more on the 'neighborhood feel'? clients for that level of estate usually want to know about the character and the kind of people living in that area to make sure it's the right fit for their family. \n\nalso, for the Midtown loft, can you do the same? maybe focus more on the 'vibe' of the immediate surroundings so they know what to expect when they walk out the front door.",
